      "value": "There appears to be a larger issue at play here with the menu/networking.  I continue to aggregate all potentially related posts of people getting stuck until this issue is solved. Here are some potentially related posts:\n\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/unable-to-move-after-adding-world-to-favourites-list\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/stuck-after-some-time-in-the-menu\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/cannot-use-portals-quick-menu-or-avatar-selection\n\nThis is also potentially related to the fix applied in vrchat 2019.1.1p1 for avatar loading.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
